WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.881
Carbon Verify turns batch-level product carbon data into evidence that others can check.

2
00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:16.287
Each unit has a defined boundary, an evidence grade and a SHA-256 commitment, with public records that anyone can recompute.

3
00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:22.615
Buyers pay for comparable evidence, while suppliers can enter basic self-declared records free.

4
00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:28.422
The platform also supports shipment packs, timestamp anchoring and API access.

5
00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:38.461
When a regulated conclusion needs a signature, an appropriately accredited partner provides it; Carbon Verify builds the evidence layer underneath.
